You are in a hurry, almost like in you dream, moving branches of the coastal trees apart, being afraid to be late. Here is the edge of the island. There was a crowd of people already, who came to watch this unprecedented event. Mech-City people usually call the edge of the island - the strand. It really looks like a strand. Grass does not grow here and everything covered with sand. When strong wind is blowing, grains of sand are lifted in the air and fall down into the fathomless depth under the island. Normally only clouds and foggy outlines of distant islands can be seen from the strand, but today everything is different. You stand still and a sigh of excitement comes out of your chest.
Wild Island is floating slowly really close. Sometimes islands' edges collide with one another, making deep rumble. Lumps of ground and sand masses come off and fall down. Earth shakes under the feet. This is thrilling and scary sight at the same time; now the idea to jump over to another island doesn't seem so fascinating any more.
You look closely at alien shores floating by. There is tangle of some tall grass with pointed acinaciform blades. Here are tall trees enmeshed in lianas. Some birds startled by the sound of collision, fly out of bushes from time to time. You can hear howls of unseen animals in foreign forest.
Suddenly a small fluffy animal jumped right out to the shore. One long hop and it is in front of you. Snoopy is barking furiously at it. Frightened animal jumps back. Now Snoopy breaks loose and runs after animal, before you can stop him. They both vanish in the forest before you know it.  